Hotel Booking & Cancellation Dashboard

Project Overview
This project analyzes hotel booking data using Microsoft Power BI to understand booking patterns, cancellations, and customer behavior.

Objectives
- Analyze total hotel bookings.
- Understand booking cancellation patterns.
- Compare City Hotel and Resort Hotel performance.
- Identify trends in booking lead time and average daily rate (ADR).

Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- CSV Dataset
- Microsoft Excel (if used)

Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
- Total Bookings
- Total Cancellations
- Cancellation Rate
- Average Daily Rate (ADR)
- Average Lead Time

